WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.666
Checkpoint 2 asks for justification This is more
important than

00:00:05.692 --> 00:00:11.201
memorizing the label Explain why ZIP code is nominal
even when

00:00:11.228 --> 00:00:17.047
stored as an integer Explain why Celsius supports
meaningful differences

00:00:17.073 --> 00:00:22.713
but not meaningful ratios Explain why arbitrary
integer codes

00:00:22.739 --> 00:00:28.572
can mislead a model when categories are unordered If
you can explain the reason

00:00:28.586 --> 00:00:32.914
in ordinary language you understand the concept well
enough to apply it elsewhere
